# Example crontab entry for the weekly Hansard update.
# Install with `crontab -e` (or `crontab scripts/crontab.example` to replace).
#
# Runs every Monday at 03:30 server time. The wrapper handles venv, locking,
# logging, and .env loading; secrets live in .env, never here.
#
# Note: cron has a minimal environment and no SSH agent — the deploy key must be
# passphraseless and referenced via GIT_SSH_COMMAND in .env. See docs/publishing.md.

30 3 * * 1 /home/sr/a2aj-hansard/scripts/weekly_update.sh
